        "created_at": "2018-10-09T22:38:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's making them <em>dream</em> about turning on each other! Or the Dahan attacking. Or both.</p>\n<p>Nothing's worse than waking up from a dream more than once...</p>",
