        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lorkenpeist/{size}/1959_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-10T21:46:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Volcanic eruption? Tigers chewing your face off? Disease causing your skin to melt? Floodwater washing away you and your home and everyone you know and all their houses too? Nope, not really - it's all inside your head.\n</p></blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And yet somehow that volcanic eruption leaves actual blight on the island.</p>",
