      {
        "id": 222939,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-11T01:05:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The FAQ is focused on the gameplay, not thematics, so you won't find the thematic answers there. But BoDaN indeed does not destroy Dahan with Razor-Sharp Undergrowth, but does add Blight with a Volcanic Eruption.</p>\n<p>Thematically, I imagine one of those scenarios where you wake up from a dream and discover some aspect has mysteriously carried over into the real world. These are pretty popular in fiction.</p>",
